<span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif"><b><span style="border:solid #d9d9e3 1.0pt; font-size:23.5pt; padding:0cm"><span style="font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif">Link Up Privacy Policy</span></span></b></span></span></p>

<p style="border:none; margin-top:20px; margin-bottom:20px; padding:0cm"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif"><b><span style="border:solid #d9d9e3 1.0pt; font-size:10.5pt; padding:0cm"><span style="font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif">Last updated: May 17, 2023</span></span></b></span></span></p>

<p style="border:none; margin-top:20px; margin-bottom:20px; padding:0cm"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif"><span style="font-size:10.5pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif">Welcome to Link Up! This Privacy Policy describes how Link Up Inc. (&ldquo;Link Up&rdquo;, &quot;we&quot;, &quot;our&quot;, &quot;us&quot;) collects, uses, and discloses information about you when you access or use our applications, websites, and other online products and services (collectively, the &quot;Services&quot;), attend our events, or otherwise interact with us.</span></span></span></span></p>

<p style="border:none; padding:0cm"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif"><b><span style="border:solid #d9d9e3 1.0pt; font-size:16.0pt; padding:0cm"><span style="font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif">1. Information We Collect</span></span></b></span></span></p>

<p style="border:none; margin-bottom:20px; padding:0cm"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif"><b><span style="border:solid #d9d9e3 1.0pt; font-size:10.5pt; padding:0cm"><span style="font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif">Information You Provide to Us</span></span></b></span></span></p>

<p style="border:none; margin-top:20px; margin-bottom:20px; padding:0cm"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif"><span style="font-size:10.5pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif">We collect information you provide directly to us. For example, you share information directly with us when you create an account, fill out a form, post on our Services, participate in an event, communicate with us via third-party platforms, request customer support, or otherwise communicate with us. This information may include, but is not limited to, your name, email, phone number, profile picture, gender, location, and interests.</span></span></span></span></p>

<p style="border:none; margin-top:20px; margin-bottom:20px; padding:0cm"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif"><b><span style="border:solid #d9d9e3 1.0pt; font-size:10.5pt; padding:0cm"><span style="font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif">Information We Collect When You Use Our Services</span></span></b></span></span></p>

<p style="border:none; margin-top:20px; margin-bottom:20px; padding:0cm"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif"><span style="font-size:10.5pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif">We collect information about you when you use our Services, including:</span></span></span></span></p>
</div>

<div style="border:solid #d9d9e3 1.0pt; padding:0cm 0cm 0cm 5.0pt; margin-left:24px">
<ul>
	<li style="border:none; padding:0cm"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="tab-stops:list 36.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif"><b><span style="border:solid #d9d9e3 1.0pt; font-size:10.5pt; padding:0cm"><span style="font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif">Usage Information</span></span></b><span style="font-size:10.5pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif">: We collect information about your activity on our Services, such as your search queries, comments, likes, and interactions with other users.</span></span></span></span></span></li>
	<li style="border:none; padding:0cm"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="tab-stops:list 36.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif"><b><span style="border:solid #d9d9e3 1.0pt; font-size:10.5pt; padding:0cm"><span style="font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif">Device Information</span></span></b><span style="font-size:10.5pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif">: We collect information about the device and software you use to access our Services, including your IP address, web browser type, operating system version, and device identifiers.</span></span></span></span></span></li>
	<li style="border:none; padding:0cm"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="tab-stops:list 36.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif"><b><span style="border:solid #d9d9e3 1.0pt; font-size:10.5pt; padding:0cm"><span style="font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif">Location Information</span></span></b><span style="font-size:10.5pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif">: We collect information about your location when you use our Services, which helps us offer features like local events.</span></span></span></span></span></li>
	<li style="border:none; padding:0cm"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="tab-stops:list 36.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif"><b><span style="border:solid #d9d9e3 1.0pt; font-size:10.5pt; padding:0cm"><span style="font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif">Event Information</span></span></b><span style="font-size:10.5pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif">: When you participate in an event managed through our Services, we may collect information related to the event such as your attendance, interactions, and feedback.</span></span></span></span></span></li>
</ul>
</div>

<div style="border:solid #d9d9e3 1.0pt; padding:0cm 0cm 0cm 0cm">
<p style="border:none; padding:0cm"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif"><b><span style="border:solid #d9d9e3 1.0pt; font-size:16.0pt; padding:0cm"><span style="font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif">2. How We Use Your Information</span></span></b></span></span></p>

<p style="border:none; margin-bottom:20px; padding:0cm"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif"><span style="font-size:10.5pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif">We use your information for various purposes, including to:</span></span></span></span></p>
</div>

<div style="border:solid #d9d9e3 1.0pt; padding:0cm 0cm 0cm 5.0pt; margin-left:24px">
<ul>
	<li style="border:none; padding:0cm"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="tab-stops:list 36.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif"><span style="font-size:10.5pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif">Provide, maintain, and improve our Services;</span></span></span></span></span></li>
	<li style="border:none; padding:0cm"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="tab-stops:list 36.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif"><span style="font-size:10.5pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif">Process transactions and send you related information;</span></span></span></span></span></li>
	<li style="border:none; padding:0cm"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="tab-stops:list 36.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif"><span style="font-size:10.5pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif">Personalize and improve your experience on our Services;</span></span></span></span></span></li>
	<li style="border:none; padding:0cm"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="tab-stops:list 36.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif"><span style="font-size:10.5pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif">Send you technical notices, updates, and support messages;</span></span></span></span></span></li>
	<li style="border:none; padding:0cm"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="tab-stops:list 36.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif"><span style="font-size:10.5pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif">Respond to your comments, questions, and customer service requests;</span></span></span></span></span></li>
	<li style="border:none; padding:0cm"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="tab-stops:list 36.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif"><span style="font-size:10.5pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif">Communicate with you about events, offers, promotions, and information we think will be of interest to you;</span></span></span></span></span></li>
	<li style="border:none; padding:0cm"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="tab-stops:list 36.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif"><span style="font-size:10.5pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif">Monitor and analyze trends, usage, and activities connected to our Services;</span></span></span></span></span></li>
	<li style="border:none; padding:0cm"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="tab-stops:list 36.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif"><span style="font-size:10.5pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif">Detect, investigate, and prevent fraudulent transactions, abuse, and other illegal activities; and</span></span></span></span></span></li>
	<li style="border:none; padding:0cm"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="tab-stops:list 36.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif"><span style="font-size:10.5pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif">Comply with legal obligations.</span></span></span></span></span></li>
</ul>
</div>

<div style="border:solid #d9d9e3 1.0pt; padding:0cm 0cm 0cm 0cm">
<p style="border:none; padding:0cm"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif"><b><span style="border:solid #d9d9e3 1.0pt; font-size:16.0pt; padding:0cm"><span style="font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif">3. Sharing Your Information</span></span></b></span></span></p>

<p style="border:none; margin-bottom:20px; padding:0cm"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif"><span style="font-size:10.5pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif">We may share your information as follows:</span></span></span></span></p>
</div>

<div style="border:solid #d9d9e3 1.0pt; padding:0cm 0cm 0cm 5.0pt; margin-left:24px">
<ul>
	<li style="border:none; padding:0cm"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="tab-stops:list 36.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif"><span style="font-size:10.5pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif">With other users when you share content or participate in events;</span></span></span></span></span></li>
	<li style="border:none; padding:0cm"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="tab-stops:list 36.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif"><span style="font-size:10.5pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif">With vendors, consultants, and other service providers who need access to such information to carry out work on our behalf;</span></span></span></span></span></li>
	<li style="border:none; padding:0cm"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="tab-stops:list 36.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif"><span style="font-size:10.5pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif">In response to legal process or a request for information if we believe disclosure is in accordance with, or required by, any applicable law, rule, or regulation;</span></span></span></span></span></li>
	<li style="border:none; padding:0cm"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="tab-stops:list 36.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif"><span style="font-size:10.5pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif">To protect the rights, property, and safety of Link Up or others;</span></span></span></span></span></li>
	<li style="border:none; padding:0cm"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="tab-stops:list 36.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif"><span style="font-size:10.5pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif">Between and among Link Up and our current and future parents, affiliates, subsidiaries, and other companies under common control and ownership; and</span></span></span></span></span></li>
	<li style="border:none; padding:0cm"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="tab-stops:list 36.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif"><span style="font-size:10.5pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif">With your consent or at your direction.</span></span></span></span></span></li>
</ul>
</div>

<div style="border:solid #d9d9e3 1.0pt; padding:0cm 0cm 0cm 0cm">
<p style="border:none; margin-top:20px; margin-bottom:20px; padding:0cm"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif"><span style="font-size:10.5pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif">We may also share aggregated or de-identified information, which cannot reasonably be used to identify you.</span></span></span></span></p>

<p style="border:none; padding:0cm"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif"><b><span style="border:solid #d9d9e3 1.0pt; font-size:16.0pt; padding:0cm"><span style="font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif">4. Data Retention</span></span></b></span></span></p>

<p style="border:none; margin-bottom:20px; padding:0cm"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif"><span style="font-size:10.5pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif">We store the information we collect about you for as long as is necessary for the purpose(s) for which we originally collected it. We may retain certain information for legitimate business purposes or as required by law.</span></span></span></span></p>

<p style="border:none; padding:0cm"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif"><b><span style="border:solid #d9d9e3 1.0pt; font-size:16.0pt; padding:0cm"><span style="font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif">5. Your Choices</span></span></b></span></span></p>

<p style="border:none; margin-bottom:20px; padding:0cm"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif"><span style="font-size:10.5pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif">You have several choices available when it comes to your information:</span></span></span></span></p>
</div>

<div style="border:solid #d9d9e3 1.0pt; padding:0cm 0cm 0cm 5.0pt; margin-left:24px">
<ul>
	<li style="border:none; padding:0cm"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="tab-stops:list 36.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif"><b><span style="border:solid #d9d9e3 1.0pt; font-size:10.5pt; padding:0cm"><span style="font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif">Account Information</span></span></b><span style="font-size:10.5pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif">: You may update or correct your account information at any time by logging into your account and navigating to the &quot;Settings&quot; page.</span></span></span></span></span></li>
	<li style="border:none; padding:0cm"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="tab-stops:list 36.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif"><b><span style="border:solid #d9d9e3 1.0pt; font-size:10.5pt; padding:0cm"><span style="font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif">Location Information</span></span></b><span style="font-size:10.5pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif">: You can prevent your device from sharing precise location information at any time through your device&rsquo;s operating system settings.</span></span></span></span></span></li>
	<li style="border:none; padding:0cm"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="tab-stops:list 36.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif"><span style="font-size:10.5pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif">**</span></span></span></span></span></li>
</ul>
</div>

