" stroked="f" style="width:24.2pt; height:24.2pt; v-text-anchor:top"> <o:lock aspectratio="t" v:ext="edit"> <w:wrap type="none"> <w:anchorlock> </w:anchorlock></w:wrap></o:lock></v:rect><img id="_x0000_i1025" src="" style="width:24.2pt; height:24.2pt" /></span></span></p>

<div style="border:solid #d9d9e3 1.0pt; padding:0cm 0cm 0cm 0cm">
<p style="border:none; margin-bottom:20px; padding:0cm"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif"><b><span style="border:solid #d9d9e3 1.0pt; font-size:10.5pt; padding:0cm"><span style="font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif">Cookies</span></span></b><span style="font-size:10.5pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif">: Most web browsers are set to accept cookies by default. If you prefer, you can usually set your browser to remove or reject browser cookies. Please note that if you choose to remove or reject cookies, this could affect the availability and functionality of our Services.</span></span></span></span></p>
</div>

<div style="border:solid #d9d9e3 1.0pt; padding:0cm 0cm 0cm 5.0pt; margin-left:24px">
<ul>
	<li style="border:none; padding:0cm"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="tab-stops:list 36.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif"><b><span style="border:solid #d9d9e3 1.0pt; font-size:10.5pt; padding:0cm"><span style="font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif">Marketing Communications</span></span></b><span style="font-size:10.5pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif">: You can unsubscribe from our promotional emails via the link provided in the emails. Even if you opt-out of receiving promotional messages from us, you will still receive administrative messages from us.</span></span></span></span></span></li>
	<li style="border:none; padding:0cm"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="tab-stops:list 36.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif"><b><span style="border:solid #d9d9e3 1.0pt; font-size:10.5pt; padding:0cm"><span style="font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif">Deletion</span></span></b><span style="font-size:10.5pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif">: You may delete your account by visiting the &quot;Settings&quot; page on our app. Please note that we may retain certain information as required by law or for legitimate business purposes.</span></span></span></span></span></li>
</ul>
</div>

<div style="border:solid #d9d9e3 1.0pt; padding:0cm 0cm 0cm 0cm">
<p style="border:none; padding:0cm"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif"><b><span style="border:solid #d9d9e3 1.0pt; font-size:16.0pt; padding:0cm"><span style="font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif">6. Security</span></span></b></span></span></p>

