	<li style="border:none; padding:0cm"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="tab-stops:list 36.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif"><span style="font-size:10.5pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif">With your consent or at your direction.</span></span></span></span></span></li>
</ul>
</div>

<div style="border:solid #d9d9e3 1.0pt; padding:0cm 0cm 0cm 0cm">
<p style="border:none; margin-top:20px; margin-bottom:20px; padding:0cm"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif"><span style="font-size:10.5pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif">We may also share aggregated or de-identified information, which cannot reasonably be used to identify you.</span></span></span></span></p>

<p style="border:none; padding:0cm"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif"><b><span style="border:solid #d9d9e3 1.0pt; font-size:16.0pt; padding:0cm"><span style="font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif">4. Data Retention</span></span></b></span></span></p>

<p style="border:none; margin-bottom:20px; padding:0cm"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif"><span style="font-size:10.5pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif">We store the information we collect about you for as long as is necessary for the purpose(s) for which we originally collected it. We may retain certain information for legitimate business purposes or as required by law.</span></span><v:rect filled="f" id="Rectangle_x0020_4" o:gfxdata="UEsDBBQABgAIAAAAIQC75UiUBQEAAB4CAAATAAAAW0NvbnRlbnRfVHlwZXNdLnhtbKSRvU7DMBSF
