" stroked="f" style="width:24.2pt; height:24.2pt; v-text-anchor:top"> <o:lock aspectratio="t" v:ext="edit"> <w:wrap type="none"> <w:anchorlock> </w:anchorlock></w:wrap></o:lock></v:rect><img id="_x0000_i1025" src="" style="width:24.2pt; height:24.2pt" /></span></span></p>

<div style="border:solid #d9d9e3 1.0pt; padding:0cm 0cm 0cm 0cm">
<p style="border:none; padding:0cm"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif"><b><span style="border:solid #d9d9e3 1.0pt; font-size:16.0pt; padding:0cm"><span style="font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif">10. Data Transfers</span></span></b></span></span></p>

<p style="border:none; margin-bottom:20px; padding:0cm"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif"><span style="font-size:10.5pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif">The Services are hosted in the United States and intended for users located within the United States. If you choose to use the Services from the European Union or other regions of the world with laws governing data collection and use that may differ from U.S. law, then please note that you are transferring your personal information outside of those regions to the United States for storage and processing.</span></span></span></span></p>

<p style="border:none; padding:0cm"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif"><b><span style="border:solid #d9d9e3 1.0pt; font-size:16.0pt; padding:0cm"><span style="font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif">11. Third Party Services</span></span></b></span></span></p>

<p style="border:none; margin-bottom:20px; padding:0cm"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif"><span style="font-size:10.5pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif">Our Services may contain links to other websites, products, or services that we do not own or operate. We are not responsible for the privacy practices of these third parties. Please be aware that this Privacy Policy does not apply to your activities on these third-party services or any information you disclose to these third parties.</span></span></span></span></p>

<p style="border:none; padding:0cm"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif"><b><span style="border:solid #d9d9e3 1.0pt; font-size:16.0pt; padding:0cm"><span style="font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif">12. Users in California</span></span></b></span></span></p>

<p style="border:none; margin-bottom:20px; padding:0cm"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif"><span style="font-size:10.5pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif">If you are a resident of California, you have the right to request to know what personal information we collect, use, disclose, and sell about you, to delete your personal information, and to opt-out of the sale of your personal information, subject to certain exceptions. To exercise your rights, you may make these requests by contacting us at <u><span style="border:solid #d9d9e3 1.0pt; color:blue; padding:0cm"><a href="mailto:privacy@linkupvibes.com" style="color:blue; text-decoration:underline">privacy@linkupvibes.com</a></span></u>.</span></span></span></span></p>

<p style="border:none; padding:0cm"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif"><b><span style="border:solid #d9d9e3 1.0pt; font-size:16.0pt; padding:0cm"><span style="font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif">13. Users in the European Economic Area (EEA) and Switzerland</span></span></b></span></span></p>

<p style="border:none; margin-bottom:20px; padding:0cm"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif"><span style="font-size:10.5pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif">If you are a resident of the EEA or Switzerland, you have certain rights and protections under the law regarding the processing of your personal data. If you wish to access, correct, update or request deletion of your personal information, you can do so at any time by contacting us at <u><span style="border:solid #d9d9e3 1.0pt; color:blue; padding:0cm"><a href="mailto:privacy@linkupvibes.com" style="color:blue; text-decoration:underline">privacy@linkupvibes.com</a></span></u>.</span></span></span></span></p>

<p style="border:none; padding:0cm"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif"><b><span style="border:solid #d9d9e3 1.0pt; font-size:16.0pt; padding:0cm"><span style="font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif">14. Changes to the Privacy Policy</span></span></b></span></span></p>

<p style="border:none; margin-bottom:20px; padding:0cm"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif"><span style="font-size:10.5pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif">We may revise this Privacy Policy from time to time, in our sole discretion, and the most current version will always be posted on our website (as reflected in the &quot;Last Revised&quot; heading). We encourage you to review this Privacy Policy regularly for any changes.</span></span></span></span></p>

<p style="border:none; margin-top:20px; margin-bottom:20px; padding:0cm"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif"><span style="font-size:10.5pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif">By continuing to access or use the Services after any changes become effective, you agree to be bound by the revised Privacy Policy.</span></span></span></span></p>

<p style="border:none; padding:0cm"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif"><b><span style="border:solid #d9d9e3 1.0pt; font-size:16.0pt; padding:0cm"><span style="font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif">Contact Us</span></span></b></span></span></p>

<p style="border:none; margin-bottom:20px; padding:0cm"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif"><span style="font-size:10.5pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif">If you have any questions about this Privacy Policy, please contact us at <a href="mailto:privacy@linkup.com" style="color:blue; text-decoration:underline" target="_new"><span style="border:solid #d9d9e3 1.0pt; padding:0cm">privacy@linkup.com</span></a> or by postal mail addressed to:</span></span></span></span></p>

<p style="border:none; margin-top:20px; margin-bottom:20px; padding:0cm"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif"><span style="font-size:10.5pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif">Link Up Inc.<br />
Attention: Privacy Officer<br />
123 Link Up St.<br />
San Francisco, CA, 94105<br />
United States</span></span></span></span></p>

<p style="border:none; margin-top:20px; padding:0cm"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif"><span style="font-size:10.5pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif">Your privacy is important to us. We hope that our Privacy Policy helps you understand how we handle your personal information. Thank you for using Link Up!</span></span></span></span></p>
</div>

