<p><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif">Link Up is a social/dating app that connects you with people based on shared interests, lifestyles, and goals. This support document will guide you through the basics of using Link Up, from setting up your profile, connecting with others, to troubleshooting common issues.</span></span></p>

<p>&nbsp;</p>

<p><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif">Getting Started &lt;a name=&quot;getting-started&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;</span></span></p>

<p><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif">Download and Install</span></span></p>

<p>&nbsp;</p>

<p><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif">Link Up is available for download on Android and iOS devices. Visit Google Play Store or Apple App Store, search for &quot;Link Up&quot;, and then click on &quot;Install&quot; to download the app.</span></span></p>

<p>&nbsp;</p>

<p><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif">Creating an Account</span></span></p>

<p>&nbsp;</p>

<p><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif">Once you&#39;ve installed the app, open it and tap on &#39;Sign Up&#39; to create an account. You can register using your email address or a phone number. You&#39;ll be asked to create a password and confirm it.</span></span></p>

<p>&nbsp;</p>

<p><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif">Profile Creation and Customization &lt;a name=&quot;profile-creation-and-customization&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;</span></span></p>

<p><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif">Creating a Profile</span></span></p>

<p>&nbsp;</p>

<p><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif">After creating your account, you&#39;ll be prompted to set up your profile. This includes adding your name, age, gender, location, and interests. You also have the option to write a short bio about yourself.</span></span></p>

<p>&nbsp;</p>

<p><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif">Customizing Your Profile</span></span></p>

<p>&nbsp;</p>

<p><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif">You can customize your profile by adding profile pictures and choosing the interests that best represent you. To do this, click on &#39;Profile&#39;, then &#39;Edit&#39;. From here, you can update your information, change your photos, and select or deselect interests.</span></span></p>

<p>&nbsp;</p>

<p><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif">Searching and Matching &lt;a name=&quot;searching-and-matching&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;</span></span></p>

<p><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif">Searching for Matches</span></span></p>

<p>&nbsp;</p>

<p><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif">Once your profile is set, you can start looking for matches. Based on the interests and preferences you&#39;ve set, Link Up will suggest potential matches. You can also manually search for users by going to &#39;Search&#39; and entering specific criteria.</span></span></p>

<p>&nbsp;</p>

<p><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif">Matching with Others</span></span></p>

<p>&nbsp;</p>

<p><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif">If you&#39;re interested in someone, swipe right or click on the heart icon. If they also like your profile, it&#39;s a match, and you both can start messaging each other.</span></span></p>

<p>&nbsp;</p>

<p><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif">Messaging and Chat &lt;a name=&quot;messaging-and-chat&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;</span></span></p>

<p><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif">Starting a Conversation</span></span></p>

<p>&nbsp;</p>

<p><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif">After matching with someone, tap on the &#39;Chat&#39; icon on their profile to start a conversation. You can send text messages, images, and even voice notes.</span></span></p>

<p>&nbsp;</p>

<p><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif">Managing Conversations</span></span></p>

<p>&nbsp;</p>

<p><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif">You can archive, delete, or mute conversations by selecting the conversation and clicking on the respective options in the top right corner.</span></span></p>

<p>&nbsp;</p>

<p><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif">Safety and Reporting &lt;a name=&quot;safety-and-reporting&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;</span></span></p>

<p><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif">User Safety</span></span></p>

<p>&nbsp;</p>

<p><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif">Your safety is our priority. Never share sensitive personal information such as your home address, financial information, or anything you&#39;re not comfortable with. Always meet in a public place when meeting someone for the first time.</span></span></p>

<p>&nbsp;</p>

<p><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif">Reporting a User</span></span></p>

<p>&nbsp;</p>

<p><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif">If you encounter inappropriate behavior, you can report the user by going to their profile, clicking on the &#39;More&#39; button, and selecting &#39;Report&#39;. Provide as much detail as possible in the report.</span></span></p>

<p>&nbsp;</p>

<p><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif">Troubleshooting &lt;a name=&quot;troubleshooting&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;</span></span></p>

<p><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif">If you&#39;re experiencing issues with Link Up, make sure your app is updated to the latest version. Also check your device&#39;s internet connection. If problems persist, try the following:</span></span></p>

<p>&nbsp;</p>

<p><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif">App not working properly</span></span></p>

<p>&nbsp;</p>

<p><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif">Force quit the app and re-open it.</span></span></p>

<p><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif">Clear the cache and data of the app (For Android users: Settings &gt; Apps &gt; Link Up &gt; Storage &gt; Clear Cache/Data. For iOS users: Settings &gt; General &gt; iPhone Storage &gt; Link Up &gt; Offload App).</span></span></p>

<p><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif">If the issue still persists, uninstall and reinstall the app.</span></span></p>

<p><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif">Can&#39;t log in</span></span></p>

<p>&nbsp;</p>

<p><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif">Check to ensure you&#39;re entering the correct email/phone number and password.</span></span></p>

<p><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif">If you&#39;ve forgotten your password, click on &#39;Forgot password&#39; on the login page to reset it.</span></span></p>

<p><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif">Not receiving messages/notifications</span></span></p>

<p>&nbsp;</p>

<p><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif">Check your app notification settings to ensure they are turned on.</span></span></p>

<p><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif">Log out and log back into your account.</span></span></p>

<p><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif">If this doesn&#39;t work, uninstall and reinstall the app.</span></span></p>

<p><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif">If you&#39;re experiencing a different issue not covered here, please refer to the FAQ section or contact our support team.</span></span></p>

<p>&nbsp;</p>

<p><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif">FAQs &lt;a name=&quot;faqs&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;</span></span></p>

<p><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif">1. How do I change my profile picture?</span></span></p>

<p>&nbsp;</p>

<p><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif">Go to &#39;Profile&#39;, then &#39;Edit&#39;. Click on your current profile picture and choose &#39;Update photo&#39;. You can then select a photo from your device or take a new one.</span></span></p>

<p>&nbsp;</p>

<p><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif">2. Can I undo a swipe?</span></span></p>

<p>&nbsp;</p>

<p><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif">Yes, you can undo a swipe by shaking your phone immediately after swiping. This feature is only available once per day.</span></span></p>

<p>&nbsp;</p>

<p><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif">3. How do I delete my account?</span></span></p>

<p>&nbsp;</p>

<p><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif">Go to &#39;Settings&#39;, then &#39;Account Settings&#39;. Scroll to the bottom and click on &#39;Delete Account&#39;. Please note, this action is irreversible.</span></span></p>

<p>&nbsp;</p>

<p><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif">Support Contacts &lt;a name=&quot;support-contacts&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;</span></span></p>

